{
  "_notes": [
    "Map for Atari Superman and Hercules.",
    "Free Play (DIP SW A6) not mirrored in RAM/NVRAM.",
    "game_over was declared at RAM 0x00A0 (bool) with the author's own note that it was unsure among",
    "0x0C, 0x2B-0x2D, 0x7D and 0xA0. On superman it is not a game-over flag: a table sat untouched",
    "for three minutes (2026-09-11, no switch activity in the log) while 0x00A0 rose and fell",
    "seventeen times at irregular intervals from 0.25 s to 15 s, with the ball at 0 throughout --",
    "an attract-cycle blink. Withdrawn until one of the candidates is confirmed against a real game;",
    "consumers fall back to the ball (0x005A) dropping to 0."
  ],
